IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `fhog-core`
IMPORT `fhog-seat`

-- First Home Owner Grant and Shared Equity Act 2000 (NSW) -- cases for the applicant's seat and the core.
--
-- Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text (../../registers/source-bundle/act-2000-021.txt, the
-- Open Australian Legal Corpus copy of the version of 2023-09-04; not the current official text). The long argument
-- lists were laid out by the scratchpad generator gen_cases.py in the seat's canonical order; the expected values are
-- written into it by hand. Each case names the provision it tests.
--
-- A breached or still-pending DEONTIC cannot be asserted on the stable l4, so regulative rules are asserted where the
-- trace ends FULFILLED, and #TRACEd with an "-- expect:" line where it does not. Clock: days.

